 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:start\"><div><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Coverage</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Ghana</span></nav><div style=\"margin-top:32px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/gh.svg\" alt=\"Flag of Ghana\" style=\"width:96px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0\">Send money to Ghana<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:50ch\">For businesses paying suppliers, staff and partners. Pay out in GHS to MTN MoMo, Telecel Cash, AT Money and Bank. Fund from USD, EUR, GBP or the USDC and USDT stablecoins, with the rate shown before you confirm.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/payments\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">How payouts work →</a></div><a href=\"/stablecoin-payments-in-ghana\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:16px;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\">Stablecoin payments in Ghana for businesses →</a><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A;margin:20px 0 0\">Updated October 2026</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\">QUICK ANSWER</div><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:28px;margin:12px 0 0\">The fastest way for a business to send money to Ghana is a direct payout to MTN MoMo in GHS. With ElementPay it is sent on local rails with the rate and fee shown upfront, funded from fiat or stablecoins.</p></div><div style=\"border-radius:24px;background:#F6F4EF;padding:8px;display:grid;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Currency</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">GHS · Ghanaian cedi</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Payout rails</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">MTN MoMo, Telecel Cash, AT Money and Bank</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Typical delivery</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Around 30 seconds</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Hours</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Set by each local rail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Fund with</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">USD, EUR, GBP, USDC, USDT</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">GHS account</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\"><a href=\"/open-a-ghs-account\">Available →</a></span></div></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payout rails in Ghana.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><